OL,3,GNEWSABanner protest over 18 month wait
OL,4,Afor disabled bay
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor David East, executive member
OL,7,Ffor highways at Lincolnshire County
OL,8,FCouncil, said officers would "review
OL,9,Fthe situation and provide a clear
OL,10,Frecommendation so that a decision can
OL,11,Fbe made".
